On Sunday, December 07, 2014 10:32:13 Gleki Arxokuna wrote:
> Technically by {ta} we can assume a place and thus {lo ta tricu} can imply
> {lo va tricu}

Can, but does not necessarily. {ta} could refer to a castle at a medium 
distance, and the castle has a tree, which is inside the castle grounds, and 
therefore also at a medium distance. But if {ta} refers to a man who is at a 
medium distance, his tree could easily be far away.

